## Pre-commit hooks

This project uses [pre-commit](https://pre-commit.com) to enforce code quality on every
`git commit`. Selected tools: `{{ optional_deps | join("`, `") }}`.

```bash
pip install pre-commit
pre-commit install        # wire hooks into git
pre-commit run --all-files  # run everything without committing
```

See [`docs/pre-commit.md`](docs/pre-commit.md) for what each hook does, configuration
tips, and troubleshooting.
